title: "SDMAT: Species Distribution Mapping and Analysis Tool"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-11
url: "https://github.com/Alpkant/SDMAT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alpkant/SDMAT"
keywords:
  - IUCN Red List
  - Species Distribution
  - AOO
  - EOO
  - Conservation Biology
  - R-Shiny
abstract: >-
  SDMAT is an R-based utility for automating the generation of species 
  distribution maps and calculating key IUCN Red List range metrics, 
  including Extent of Occurrence (EOO) and Area of Occupancy (AOO) 
  using a standard 2x2 km grid.
